# 可用 VS Code REST Client / JetBrains HTTP Client；填入自己的本地密钥。
@base = http://127.0.0.1:18083
@clientKey = REPLACE_WITH_CLIENT_KEY
@adminKey = REPLACE_WITH_ADMIN_KEY
@messageId = REPLACE_WITH_MESSAGE_ID
@deliveryId = REPLACE_WITH_DELIVERY_ID

### 受理 JSON；相同幂等键必须保持原正文
POST {{base}}/api/v1/ingest/demo
X-Api-Key: {{clientKey}}
Idempotency-Key: example-000001
Content-Type: application/json

{"eventType":"device.status","data":{"deviceCode":"D001","online":true}}

### 查询
GET {{base}}/api/v1/messages/{{messageId}}
X-Api-Key: {{clientKey}}

### 内置同步校验
POST {{base}}/api/v1/actions/inspect
X-Api-Key: {{clientKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"deviceCode":"D001"}

### 任务概览
GET {{base}}/internal/v1/overview
X-Admin-Key: {{adminKey}}

### 实际有效配置摘要（不会输出密码）
GET {{base}}/internal/v1/config-summary
X-Admin-Key: {{adminKey}}

### 失败任务
GET {{base}}/internal/v1/deliveries?status=FAILED&limit=50&offset=0
X-Admin-Key: {{adminKey}}

### 仅修复原因并确认安全后调用，成功/UNKNOWN任务不允许普通重试
POST {{base}}/internal/v1/deliveries/{{deliveryId}}/retry
X-Admin-Key: {{adminKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"reason":"已修复目标配置，批准重试这条失败任务"}

### FTP只读连通检查；必须已启用并配置FTP
GET {{base}}/internal/v1/connectors/ftp/health
X-Admin-Key: {{adminKey}}
